KONOHAGAKURE ADMINISTRATIVE OFFICE
Welcome to the Hidden Leaf Village

On behalf of the Hokage and the Village Council, welcome to Konohagakure, the first and greatest of the Five Great Shinobi Villages, founded by Hashirama Senju and Madara Uchiha in the era that ended the age of warring clans.

As a newly registered shinobi of the Leaf, you now serve under the Will of Fire — the belief that every shinobi carries love for the village and will protect the next generation as the Hokage protects them all.

Your first days will cover:
- Headband issuance and registration at the Administration Building
- Assignment to a three-genin cell under a jonin-sensei
- Orientation on mission ranks (D through S) and the mission assignment desk
- Village conduct expectations and the shinobi rules

Report to the Mission Assignment Desk on the ground floor to receive your registration packet. Questions may be directed to the Academy administration or your assigned jonin-sensei.

May the Will of Fire burn bright in you.
— Office of the Hokage
